{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b124140cf669bf44304c675a38d6e530b9d2ae528039d053fdfabf471a33ecff", "ja": "星梨花、ブログ読んだぞ。\n衣装気に入ってもらえたんだな、良かった。", "zh": "星梨花，我看过部落格啰。\n看来你很喜欢那套服装呢，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
