{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "660a0371238c517c1d89c5ef9db48abe902c03ab104860315fa2f9e4eccf8e86", "ja": "なるほど。もしかしたら、ラッピングされた\nプレゼントの気持ちになるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此，\n或许穿起来会觉得自己像个精心包装的礼物吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "cb826037e496f0c9335583f9d1830804c7318d3322b8a85cf8318210af496fd9", "ja": "わたしが、プレゼントなんですか？\n……。", "zh": "我是礼物吗？\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "d55057b37930717b74032e57ec739b5dc910ba98293966890b94d3680219639c", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、わたしが\nプレゼントですって届いたら、うれしいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，如果我说自己是礼物，\n把自己送给你的话，你会高兴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d721116aa28cff352439d534e69dc557db2625f1840513f495f2f1f6fa23d76e", "ja": "えっ。それは、なかなかのサプライズだな。\nもちろん、うれしいけど……。", "zh": "咦？这还真是个大惊喜呢。\n当然会高兴啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c6a815fe94145da26a3a814f3fe508eedc632a9b02656a24096eff750db33f8f", "ja": "どうせなら、アイドルの星梨花の魅力を、\nプレゼントとしてみんなに届けたいかな？", "zh": "但我应该更希望能把偶像星梨花的魅力当作礼物，\n分送给大家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "6f93e7a47d4c81a3cc08e329b47e668e38b730a054f9fafd62db1a5faedbf5d9", "ja": "アイドルとしてのわたし……\nそれって、歌とかダンスですよね？", "zh": "偶像星梨花……\n那就是指唱歌和跳舞对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "9dee01bd1e501e46d406dbfb57990b6e96202f582252ce5ebd5613efbc8aaf07", "ja": "けど、わたしの歌やダンスで、\n亜美さんと真美さんはよろこんでくれるでしょうか？", "zh": "但不知道我的歌舞表演能不能\n让亚美姊姊和真美姊姊开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1010_p", "source_sha256": "126151d19aa7b4b5b33c949c06caf6b8383c8450b7b46bfb163e3e454672d1bb", "ja": "亜美と真美？　あ、もうすぐふたりの誕生日だっけ。\n何かプレゼントを贈るつもりなのか？", "zh": "亚美和真美？啊，她们的生日快到了吧。\n你打算送她们什么礼物吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "e7f28abb5d8421a71d7aae9025ad8a4000228ea0f1b092075172784a5e361e96", "ja": "はい！　どうしたらおふたりに\nよろこんでもらえるか、考えてるんですけど……。", "zh": "是的！\n不过我还在想怎样才能让她们开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "65fed063f715c780636a8a7288bd643610dc1d83c53dbb541a1efc5733c2d3a6", "ja": "亜美さんと真美さんは、サプライズのほうが\nよろこんでくれるかも……？", "zh": "亚美姊姊和真美姊姊\n可能会比较喜欢惊喜吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f6a403120cf97b1c348619f0501f89fb18bf5ff5f84142b5f6ab77a95b516b37", "ja": "確かにあのふたりなら大喜びしそうだけど、\nやめておいた方がいいかな……。", "zh": "的确，她们两个应该会非常开心，\n但还是别那样做比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4a358d0abc4e00e65343e38cc46260052b9dc4091fc791c5e1e581b41312623b", "ja": "それに星梨花自身じゃなくても、星梨花が一生懸命\n考えたものなら、ふたりとも喜んでくれると思うよ。", "zh": "而且就算不把你自己当作礼物，只要是星梨花你\n努力想出来的点子，她们也一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "7725800cc5befc5cbe726faadaae3f712b48f67b4383db1871e7b28d556e72c2", "ja": "そうですか？\nうーん、何がいいでしょう……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n唔～那要送什么好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "544c35eff577fc9ba75b78f4b3ca7f483f03ae37b8b88d920f1c80c6a3b56df5", "ja": "よし、俺にも手伝えることがあれば言ってくれ。\nふたりへのプレゼント、一緒に考えよう。", "zh": "好，要是我帮得上忙，尽管告诉我。\n我们一起想想该送她们什么礼物吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "bb8d80a54c44edbb1eb9db78bc166c9818c62e48ecbc3fd0ba74c4ebb49bca82", "ja": "わあ、本当ですか！？\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "a24ed2533a7ce787d54455a582ca3d55935c3c3bdcd73df43c1aaacecdb8a740", "ja": "{$P$}さんが協力してくれたら、\n百人力ですね。よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "有{$P$}先生帮忙一起想，\n心里感觉踏实多了，再麻烦你帮忙了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0114_1019_p", "source_sha256": "494f6f882b3292c5ad9597e4ce6e946e496d46114f8ac7e520193838db2f57ae", "ja": "（相手の事を、一生懸命に考えてお祝いする……。\n亜美と真美には、最高の誕生日祝いになりそうだな）", "zh": "（拚命思考如何帮对方庆祝……\n对亚美和真美来说，这应该会成为最棒的生日祝福。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
